    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">excrēmentum</span></b> ,
		i, n.
		excerno. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>What is sifted out</i>, <i>the
			refuse</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 5, 25</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Pall. Febr. 26, 3</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. Nov. 20, 4</span></i>.—More
			freq., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>What passes from the body</i>, <i>excrement</i>, <i>ordure</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 11,
				26, 32, § 94</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 45, 68, §
			147</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oris,</span>”
				<i>spittle</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					4, 81</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">narium,</span>”
				<i>mucus of the nose</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					16, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
